1-1.947.449c-.649.083-1.267.124-1.855.124a9.696 9.696 0 0 1-3.402-.59 7.811 7.811 0 0 1-2.779-1.755c-.793-.777-1.42-1.742-1.88-2.895-.46-1.154-.69-2.496-.69-4.027 0-1.153.196-2.246.59-3.277a8.067 8.067 0 0 1 1.697-2.712 8.083 8.083 0 0 1 2.679-1.847c1.048-.455 2.232-.682 3.552-.682"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="problem" class="relative"><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-4 pt-16 lg:pt-32 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 2xl:px-0 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16"><div class="px-6 md:px-0 lg:pl-12"><p class="text-xs uppercase text-rose-600 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-2">Screenshots under scrutiny</p><h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl text-balance max-w-xl lg:text-[1.625rem]">Manual screenshots are slow. Cheap automation is risky.</h2><p class="mt-8 text-balance max-w-xl">Taking screenshots yourself is tedious and inconsistent. Most automated tools quietly cut corners that undermine your credibility.</p><ul class="mt-8 space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-x size-5 text-rose-600 flex-none mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><line x1="15" x2="9" y1="9" y2="15"></line><line x1="9" x2="15" y1="9" y2="15"></line></svg><span>Auditors, regulators, and clients question their authenticity</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-x size-5 text-rose-600 flex-none mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m14.5 9.5-5 5"></path><path d="m9.5 9.5 5 5"></path></svg><span>Low-cost tools introduce real security and compliance risks</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bug size-5 text-rose-600 flex-none mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 2 1.88 1.88"></path><path d="M14.12 3.88 16 2"></path><path d="M9 7.13v-1a3.003 3.003 0 1 1 6 0v1"></path><path d="M12 20c-3.3 0-6-2.7-6-6v-3a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v3c0 3.3-2.7 6-6 6"></path><path d="M12 20v-9"></path><path d="M6.53 9C4.6 8.8 3 7.1 3 5"></path><path d="M6 13H2"></path><path d="M3 21c0-2.1 1.7-3.9 3.8-4"></path><path d="M20.97 5c0 2.1-1.6 3.8-3.5 4"></path><path d="M22 13h-4"></path><path d="M17.2 17c2.1.1 3.8 1.9 3.8 4"></path></svg><span>Rendering bugs, missing content, and layout glitches are common</span></li></ul><p class="mt-8 text-balance max-w-xl">When screenshots are used as evidence, records, or design inputs, those flaws matter.<!-- --> </p></div><div class="px-6 md:px-0 md:pr-12"><p class="text-xs uppercase text-indigo-600 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-2">Screenshots that hold up</p><h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl max-w-xl lg:text-[1.625rem]"><span class="block text-balance">Urlbox&#x27;s trusted Web Vision Engine™</span><span class="block text-balance">Clean, credible captures with context.</span></h2><p class="mt-8 text-balance max-w-xl">Capture thousands of complete web pages in seconds — with the accuracy, precision, and context that matters.<!-- --> </p><p class="mt-8 text-balance max-w-xl">Even emojis, fonts, and animations render the way a real designer on a Mac would expect.</p><div class="mt-8 flex"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 sm:hidden"><a class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-button font-medium transition-all duration-200 ease-out outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-linear-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 text-white ring-4 ring-[rgb(22_88_155/0.06)] hover:from-indigo-600 hover:to-indigo-700 dark:ring-slate-800 h-10 rounded-xl px-4 text-base" data-slot="button" href="/products/screenshot-api">Try it with the API</a><a class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-button font-medium transition-all duration-200 ease-out outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-linear-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 text-white ring-4 ring-[rgb(22_88_155/0.06)] hover:from-indigo-600 hover:to-indigo-700 dark:ring-slate-800 h-10 rounded-xl px-4 text-base" data-slot="button" href="/products/capturedeck">upload a list of sites</a></div><div class="hidden sm:flex rounded-xl ring-4 ring-slate-100"><a class="h-10 relative flex group" href="/products/screenshot-api"><span class="h-full bg-linear-to-b from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 group-hover:opacity-90 text-white px-4 rounded-l-xl flex items-center font-medium">Try it with the API</span><svg viewBox="0 0 58 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-full group-hover:opacity-90"><path d="M0 100V0H58L0 100Z" fill="url(#paint0_linear_779_11)"></path><defs><linearGradient id="paint0_linear_779_11" x1="29" y1="0" x2="29" y2="100" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#615FFF"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4F39F6"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg></a><div class="relative flex items-center -ml-6 z-10"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 110" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 opacity-25"><path d="M63.4336 0.25L40.4336 40.0872M18.4336 78.1934L0.433594 109.37" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke="white"></path></svg><span class="text-white/80 absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">or</span></div><a class="h-10 relative flex group -ml-6" href="/products/capturedeck"><svg viewBox="0 0 58 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-full group-hover:opacity-90"><path d="M58 0L58 100H0L58 0Z" fill="url(#paint0_linear_780_14)"></path><defs><linearGradient id="paint0_linear_780_14" x1="29" y1="0" x2="29" y2="100" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#615FFF"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4F39F6"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><span class="h-full bg-linear-to-b from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 group-hover:opacity-90 text-white px-4 rounded-r-xl flex items-center font-medium">upload a list of sites</span></a></div></div><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm mt-8"><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-3.5 text-indigo-600 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 0 1 .143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 0 1 1.05-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>API for developers</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-3.5 text-indigo-600 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 0 1 .143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 0 1 1.05-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>CSV &amp; lists for teams</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-3.5 text-indigo-600 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 0 1 .143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 0 1 1.05-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>Sales &amp; compliance support</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="bento" class="relative"><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-4 pt-16 lg:pt-32 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 2xl:px-0"><div class="relative bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl text-sm"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="flex flex-col p-6 lg:pl-12 border-b md:border-r border-slate-200 lg:border-b-0"><span class="text-2xl text-slate-800">800M+</span><span class="text-black">Screenshots</span></div><div class="flex flex-col p-6 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-slate-200"><span class="text-2xl text-slate-800">1,700+</span><span class="text-black">Customers</span></div><div class="flex flex-col p-6 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-200"><span class="text-2xl text-slate-800">20,000+</span><span class="text-black">Developers</span></div><div class="flex flex-col p-6 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-200"><span class="text-2xl text-slate-800">13+</span><span class="text-black">Years of experience</span></div><div class="flex flex-col p-6 pr-12"><span class="text-2xl text-slate-800">99.99%</span><span class="text-black">Uptime SLA</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 border-y border-slate-200"><div class="relative border-b md:border-r border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="Full page screenshots" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Ffull-page.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Ffull-page.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Ffull-page.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#full-page-screenshots"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">Full page screenshots</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Capture the full scrollable height of any page and deliver it as a single, seamless image like a real user would see it.</span></div></div><div class="relative border-b border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="Clean screenshots" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fclean-screenshots.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fclean-screenshots.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fclean-screenshots.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#clean-screenshots"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">Clean, uncluttered captures</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Modals, banners, and overlays are removed so pages appear the way they were meant to be seen.</span></div></div><div class="relative border-b md:border-r border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="100+ options to fine-tune captures" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fcontrols.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fcontrols.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fcontrols.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#render-options"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">100+ options to fine-tune captures</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Delay, scroll, click, wait, clip, localise, timezone, stealth mode, block scripts.</span></div></div><div class="relative border-b border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="Output formats" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Furlbox-output-formats.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Furlbox-output-formats.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Furlbox-output-formats.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#output-formats"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">Any format you need</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Turn URLs or HTML into images, video, PDFs, and structured data.</span></div></div><div class="relative border-b md:border-r border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="Forensic-grade context" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fforensic-grade-context.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fforensic-grade-context.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fforensic-grade-context.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#forensic-grade-context"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">Forensic-grade context</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Simultaneously capture HTML, text, metadata, and cryptographic timestamps.</span></div></div><div class="relative border-b border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="Screenshots without getting blocked" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fpov-globe.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fpov-globe.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fpov-globe.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#geo-stealth"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">Screenshots without getting blocked</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Pick a point of view and capture pages as they appear to users anywhere around the world — bypassing bot detection, IP blocks, and geographic restrictions.</span></div></div><div class="relative border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="The best of speed and accuracy" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fperformance.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fperformance.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fperformance.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#performance"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">The best of speed and accuracy</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Every capture prioritises correctness by default, but you can tune performance and accuracy to match your needs.</span></div></div><div class="relative border-b md:border-b-0 border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-8 p-12 hover:bg-slate-50/50"><img alt="Detect visual changes" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fchange-detection.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fchange-detection.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2F2026%2Ficons%2Fchange-detection.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col"><a href="#change-detection"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl">Detect any change</h3><span class="absolute inset-0"></span></a><span class="mt-3">Image, text, and metadata captured together so you can spot layout shifts, copy updates, or silent HTML changes.</span></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-5 text-black"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-6 lg:pl-12 border-b lg:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-200 md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-4.5 flex-none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12.516 2.17a.75.75 0 0 0-1.032 0 11.209 11.209 0 0 1-7.877 3.08.75.75 0 0 0-.722.515A12.74 12.74 0 0 0 2.25 9.75c0 5.942 4.064 10.933 9.563 12.348a.749.749 0 0 0 .374 0c5.499-1.415 9.563-6.406 9.563-12.348 0-1.39-.223-2.73-.635-3.985a.75.75 0 0 0-.722-.516l-.143.001c-2.996 0-5.717-1.17-7.734-3.08Zm3.094 8.016a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>SOC 2 Type II</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-6 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-slate-200 md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 426 423" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="fill-current size-8 flex-none"><path d="M213.47 17.465L204.97 43.6258L218.051 47.8759L213.47 17.465Z"></path><path d="M213.47 17.465L221.971 43.6258L208.89 47.8759L213.47 17.465Z"></path><path d="M239.631 36.472H212.124V50.2255L239.631 36.472Z"></path><path d="M239.631 36.472L217.378 52.6403L209.293 41.5134L239.631 36.472Z"></path><path d="M229.639 67.2259L221.138 41.0651L208.058 45.3151L229.639