-w-xl">Try your first 10,000 screenshots risk-free. If you’re not satisfied, we’ll refund up to $100 — no awkward conversations.</p></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center order-1 md:order-2"><svg viewBox="0 0 176 176" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-24 rotate-6 md:h-32 lg:h-48"><path d="M14.9839 40.2575C11.6744 50.34 9.99201 60.8853 10 71.4971C10.0021 118.111 41.88 157.242 85.0073 168.349C86.9697 168.854 89.0282 168.854 90.9907 168.349C134.122 157.25 166 118.116 166 71.4999C166 60.6037 164.252 50.0918 161.014 40.2443C159.395 35.3204 154.798 31.9926 149.615 31.9926H148.5C128.249 31.9926 109.877 24.0989 96.2533 11.1915C91.621 6.80261 84.3639 6.8068 79.7367 11.201C65.4041 24.8118 46.3164 32.2769 26.5528 32.0011C21.3061 31.9279 16.6203 35.272 14.9839 40.2575Z" fill="#10B981" fill-opacity="0.1" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M88 19.9026C71.3954 35.671 49.2819 44.3195 26.3854 43.9999C23.4728 52.8731 21.9925 62.1536 22 71.4926C22 112.501 50.0427 146.953 88 156.728C125.957 146.96 154 112.508 154 71.4999C154 61.8933 152.46 52.6459 149.615 43.9926H148.5C125.063 43.9926 103.767 34.8406 88 19.9026Z" fill="#10B981" fill-opacity="0.1"></path><path d="M88 19.9026C71.3954 35.671 49.2819 44.3195 26.3854 43.9999C23.4728 52.8731 21.9925 62.1536 22 71.4926C22 112.501 50.0427 146.953 88 156.728C125.957 146.96 154 112.508 154 71.4999C154 61.8933 152.46 52.6459 149.615 43.9926H148.5C125.063 43.9926 103.767 34.8406 88 19.9026Z" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M88 45C82.1652 45 76.5695 47.3179 72.4437 51.4437C68.3179 55.5695 66 61.1652 66 67V78.0385C62.918 78.2761 60.0088 79.6064 57.8076 81.8076C55.3696 84.2456 54 87.5522 54 91V118C54 121.448 55.3696 124.754 57.8076 127.192C60.2456 129.63 63.5522 131 67 131H109C112.448 131 115.754 129.63 118.192 127.192C120.63 124.754 122 121.448 122 118V91C122 87.5522 120.63 84.2456 118.192 8