20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-4"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 10a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h12.59l-2.1-1.95a.75.75 0 1 1 1.02-1.1l3.5 3.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.1l-3.5 3.25a.75.75 0 1 1-1.02-1.1l2.1-1.95H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 10Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start px-6 md:px-0 lg:pr-12"><p class="text-xs uppercase text-indigo-600 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-2">CaptureDeck</p><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-xl sm:text-2xl max-w-xl">Turn lists of URLs into ready-to-use reports</h3><p class="my-8 text-balance max-w-xl">Upload a CSV or paste a list to instantly produce clean screenshots, ZIP archives, and audit-ready PDF reports — no developers required.</p><a class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-button font-medium transition-all duration-200 ease-out outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-linear-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-600 text-white ring-4 ring-[rgb(22_88_155/0.06)] hover:from-indigo-600 hover:to-indigo-700 dark:ring-slate-800 h-9 rounded-xl px-4 text-base" data-slot="button" href="/products/capturedeck"><span>Learn more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-4"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 10a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h12.59l-2.1-1.95a.75.75 0 1 1 1.02-1.1l3.5 3.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.1l-3.5 3.25a.75.75 0 1 1-1.02-1.1l2.1-1.95H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 10Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></main><footer class="bg-slate-900 py-16 text-sm text-slate-400 lg:py-32"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) px-4 pb-8 lg:flex lg:items-start lg:justify-between  2xl:px-0"><div class="space-y-4 pr-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 137 32" 